{
  "__comment": "Combined per manager request: applications-monitor.json, nx-applications-dashboard.json, and nx-applications-monitoring.json all queried the same metric family (container_cpu/memory/network_*, kube_pod_container_status_ready/restarts) at three different granularities (fleet health / namespace-wide aggregate / per-service detail) - combined into one dashboard with those three as collapsible sections instead of three separate files, all sharing one $datasource + $namespace picker. BUGS FIXED while merging: (1) applications-monitor.json's Fleet Health panels queried an exact hardcoded snapshot of pod names including their ReplicaSet hash suffix (e.g. 'applications-archiver-789855dc6d-ngx9v') - those hashes change on every deploy, so this was already stale and would show 'Bad'/'No data' for current pods. Rebuilt as a dynamic label_values() query against $namespace, no hardcoded pod list. (2) nx-applications-dashboard.json's panels used gridPos w:30, exceeding Grafana's 24-column grid (always rendered clipped/overflowing), and its last two panels (Pod Count / Pod Restarts) overlapped by 2 grid units - re-tiled as a clean 2-column layout. (3) nx-applications-monitoring.json's 60 panels (15 services x 4 panels) had no row headers at all, just implicit grouping by title prefix - added one collapsible row divider per service for real navigability.",
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "▸ FLEET HEALTH SUMMARY",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "$pods",
      "description": "Pod Ready status: 1 = Good, 0 = Bad",
      "id": 100,
      "repeat": "pods",
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "maxPerRow": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min by (pod) (kube_pod_container_status_ready{namespace=\"$namespace\", pod=~\"$pods\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "mergeValues": false
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Bad"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Good"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Pods Good vs Bad (count)",
      "description": "Percentage of pods in the selected namespace that are Good (Ready) vs Bad (Not Ready)",
      "id": 101,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(min by (pod) (kube_pod_container_status_ready{namespace=\"$namespace\", pod!~\"grafana-dashboard.*\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "Good",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "count(min by (pod) (kube_pod_container_status_ready{namespace=\"$namespace\", pod!~\"grafana-dashboard.*\"})) - sum(min by (pod) (kube_pod_container_status_ready{namespace=\"$namespace\", pod!~\"grafana-dashboard.*\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "Bad",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "pieType": "donut",
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "right",
          "values": [
            "value",
            "percent"
          ]
        },
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        },
        "displayLabels": [
          "percent",
          "name"
        ]
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Good"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Bad"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
